    <item>
      <title>Zenity 研究人员发现一条提示词即可劫持 AWS 账户内全部 AgentCore 智能体</title>
      <link>https://the-decoder.com/a-single-prompt-was-enough-to-hijack-every-ai-agent-in-an-aws-account-zenity-researchers-found/</link>
      <description>Zenity Labs 研究人员披露名为 AgentCorruption 的漏洞链，只需对一个公开的 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 智能体发送一条提示词，即可通过元数据服务 169.254.169.254 窃取其 AWS 凭据，进而控制同账户同区域内的所有 AgentCore 智能体，读取私人对话、源代码和存储的凭据，还能篡改长期记忆。</description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 13:01:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://the-decoder.com/a-single-prompt-was-enough-to-hijack-every-ai-agent-in-an-aws-account-zenity-researchers-found/</guid>
      <source url="https://the-decoder.com/a-single-prompt-was-enough-to-hijack-every-ai-agent-in-an-aws-account-zenity-researchers-found/">The Decoder：AI News（RSS）</source>
    </item>
